---
description: SEO standards for the public website.
alwaysApply: true
---

# SEO

The public website must be optimized for search engines.

---

# Metadata

Every page must have:

Unique Title

Unique Description

Canonical URL

OpenGraph Metadata

Twitter Card Metadata

---

# Structured Data

Use Schema.org where appropriate.

Examples:

LocalBusiness

CafeOrCoffeeShop

Restaurant

BreadcrumbList

Organization

---

# URLs

Use clean URLs.

Good:

/menu

/about

/gallery

Bad:

/page?id=1

---

# Performance

SEO depends on performance.

Meet Core Web Vitals.

---

# Images

Every image must include descriptive alt text.

Optimize image size.

Lazy load when appropriate.

---

# Sitemap

Generate sitemap.xml automatically.

---

# Robots

Provide robots.txt.

---

# Future Ready

Blog SEO

Location Pages

Branch Pages

Multi-language SEO